# Project Context (auto-generated by /init)

## Overview
DKPrint CRM is an operational CRM for a print shop / photo-center network. Phase 0 is in place (Neon client, Credentials auth, money/permissions/status stubs); R2 and business UI start in Phase 1+.

## Tech Stack
- Language: TypeScript 5.x (strict)
- Framework: Next.js 16.3 (App Router) + React 19
- Auth: Auth.js / next-auth v5 beta (Credentials + JWT)
- Styling: Tailwind CSS v4
- Money: decimal.js; validation: zod
- Package manager: npm (`package-lock.json`)
- Test framework: Node.js `node:test` via `tsx`
- DB: Postgres/Neon via `@neondatabase/serverless` (`src/lib/db`)

## Directory Structure
```
src/app/                 # App Router pages + API routes
src/auth/                # Auth.js config (handlers, auth, signIn/signOut)
src/lib/                 # Domain modules (auth, db, money, orders)
migrations/              # 001_init.sql + seed.sql; admin via npm run seed:admin
docs/                    # DKPrint-CRM-TZ-v1.md (canonical spec)
design-system/dkprint-crm/  # design tokens / styles
.cursor/rules/           # always-on invariants + this file
.github/workflows/       # CI
public/                  # static assets
```
Not a monorepo — single package at repo root.

## Commands
- Install: `npm install` (CI: `npm ci`)
- Dev: `npm run dev`
- Build: `npm run build` / `npm start`
- Test: `npm test`
- Lint: `npm run lint`
- Typecheck: `npm run typecheck`
- Format: `npm run format` / `npm run format:check`
- DB: apply `migrations/*.sql` manually, then `npm run seed:admin`


## Conventions
- Path alias `@/*` → `./src/*`
- Flat `src/app` + `src/lib`; no repository/CQRS layers
- Domain helpers often kebab-case files; modules use `index.ts`
- Prettier: single quotes, semis, trailing commas
- Unit tests colocated as `*.test.ts` under `src/lib/`
- Prefer native HTML controls; Tailwind utilities
- Invariants live in `00-dkprint-invariants.mdc` (auth/money/status/R2/permissions)

## Key Files
- `docs/DKPrint-CRM-TZ-v1.md` — product/tech source of truth (v1.3)
- `migrations/001_init.sql` — Postgres schema
- `src/auth/index.ts` — Auth.js Credentials authorize + JWT session
- `scripts/seed-admin.ts` — first admin from SEED_ADMIN_* env
- `src/lib/auth/permissions.ts` — roles + `can()`
- `src/lib/auth/assertOrderAccess.ts` — order isolation / visibility
- `src/lib/money/index.ts` — Decimal money math for API/DB
- `src/lib/orders/order-number.ts` — `DK-YYMMDD-N` format
- `package.json` — scripts and dependencies
- `.env.example` — env surface (DB, Auth, R2, VAPID, Telegram)
- `AGENTS.md` — pointers to TZ, design-system, cursor rules
